# cards: auto battle with a card worn (docs/plan-cards.md 7.4). Jian (level 9) and Lucia both wear Quetzalcoatl
# (two in the bag, the points 2000); Right then A at the first battle screen picks Auto. Over several rounds nobody uses the
# card unbidden (enemy HP pinned so the battle lasts) (points stay 2000) and the battle goes on (shots ct_*).
include party2_strong
poke u8 0x0213BA1B 2
poke u16 0x020B48AC 2000
poke u16 0x020B46FE 236
poke u16 0x020B46A2 236
poke u32 0x020B4664 8
pin u32 0x0228ea24 500
pin u32 0x0228ea90 500
pin u32 0x0228eafc 500
pin u32 0x0228ebd4 500
pin u32 0x0228ec40 500
pin u32 0x0228ecac 500
wait 270
watch u16 0x020B48AC points
watch u32 0x020B0010 state
press Right 8
wait 60
press A 8
wait 60
press A 8
wait 600
shot ct_00
wait 600
shot ct_01
wait 600
shot ct_02
wait 600
shot ct_03
